321
00:14:03,802 --> 00:14:05,219
SHE'S A CYBORG.

322
00:14:07,430 --> 00:14:08,723
A CYBORG?

323
00:14:08,765 --> 00:14:10,350
ISN'T THAT LIKE A ROBOT?

324
00:14:10,391 --> 00:14:14,312
YEAH. THIS BOOK WAS LIGHT YEARS
AHEAD OF ITS TIME.

325
00:14:16,063 --> 00:14:17,064
