WHAT IS THE BIG DEAL?

381
00:16:46,130 --> 00:16:49,091
I THOUGHT THIS WAS GOING TO BE
SOMETHING WE COULD DO TOGETHER.

382
00:16:49,133 --> 00:16:50,927
YOU KNOW, I THOUGHT
IT WOULD BE FUN.

383
00:16:50,969 --> 00:16:52,136
WELL, YEAH, FUN IS GOOD

384
00:16:52,178 --> 00:16:54,054
BUT, YOU KNOW, I ALSO
WANTED TO LEARN.

385
00:16:54,096 --> 00:16:55,473
YOU KNOW, PEOPLE ARE ALWAYS

386
