THE QUESTION.

394
00:17:25,461 --> 00:17:27,839
OH, YEAH.

395
00:17:30,633 --> 00:17:33,177
( gasps )

396
00:17:37,431 --> 00:17:38,432
( gasps )

397
00:17:38,474 --> 00:17:40,309
