410
00:18:06,961 --> 00:18:08,713
ALL RIGHT, WAIT,
JUST WAIT.

411
00:18:08,755 --> 00:18:10,798
EVERYBODY JUST
CALM DOWN, OKAY?

412
00:18:10,840 --> 00:18:13,593
