413
00:18:13,634 --> 00:18:15,344
WHY HE'S SUCH
A BIG PERVERT.

414
00:18:15,386 --> 00:18:18,848
NO, I AM NOT A PERVERT, OKAY?

415
00:18:18,890 --> 00:18:22,018
IT'S JUST, I JUST KIND OF...

416
00:18:22,060 --> 00:18:25,772
OH LOOK, LOOK,
I THINK I CAN EXPLAIN THIS.

417
00:18:25,813 --> 00:18:28,190
