TO EXPLAIN

425
00:18:45,666 --> 00:18:46,960
ALL THIS STUFF.

426
00:18:47,001 --> 00:18:49,378
NO, IT ISN'T.
NO, IT'S NOT.

427
00:18:49,420 --> 00:18:52,048
