EXPLAIN IT WITH THE TRUTH.

428
00:18:52,090 --> 00:18:53,633
Rachel:
WELL, WHAT IS
THE TRUTH?

429
00:18:53,674 --> 00:18:54,634
YEAH.

430
00:18:54,675 --> 00:18:56,343
YEAH, WHAT'S
GOING ON?

431
