FOR MY RAGE.

439
00:19:32,338 --> 00:19:35,883
MONICA, IS THIS TRUE?

440
00:19:35,925 --> 00:19:37,426
OF COURSE IT'S TRUE.

441
00:19:37,468 --> 00:19:40,888
