THE OTHER DAY?

447
00:19:51,231 --> 00:19:52,358
UH... OY.

448
00:19:52,399 --> 00:19:54,110
THAT WAS THE UNDERWEAR

449
00:19:54,152 --> 00:19:57,279
I WAS WEARING
THAT NIGHT IN LONDON.

450
00:19:57,321 --> 00:19:58,656
RIGHT, MONICA?

451
00:20:01,993 --> 00:20:04,037
I GUESS I WANTED TO KEEP IT...

452
00:20:05,329 --> 00:20:06,956
AS A SOUVENIR.

453
