THE VIDEO CAMERA

467
00:20:41,323 --> 00:20:44,535
TO TRY AND ENTICE JOEY.

468
00:20:44,577 --> 00:20:48,081
BUT, SADLY,
I COULD NOT
BE ENTICED.

469
00:20:49,623 --> 00:20:51,042
THIS IS UNBELIEVABLE.

470
00:20:51,084 --> 00:20:53,836
