I'M ONLY EATING THE SKIN

482
00:21:26,119 --> 00:21:29,038
SO THE CHICKEN'S UP FOR GRABS.

483
00:21:35,962 --> 00:21:37,130
YOU WERE MAKING

484
00:21:37,171 --> 00:21:39,799
