UNTIL YOU
GOT CUT OFF.

485
00:21:39,840 --> 00:21:42,509
I KNOW. WHAT'S UP
WITH THAT GIRL MONICA?

486
00:21:42,551 --> 00:21:44,595
I DON'T KNOW.
I DIDN'T COME
WITH HER.

487
00:21:46,513 --> 00:21:47,514
HEY, EVERYBODY.

488
00:21:47,556 --> 00:21:48,975
EVERYBODY, GUESS WHAT?

489
00:21:49,016 --> 00:21:51,769
I JUST CONVINCED CARL
TO GIVE US A TEST NEXT WEEK.

490
00:21:51,811 --> 00:21:53,146
A TEST?!

491
00:21:53,187 --> 00:21:56,023
OH, COME ON, TESTS
MAKE US ALL BETTER LEARNERS.

492
00:21:57,691 --> 00:21:59,819
OH, YEAH! WE SHOULD
HAVE ESSAY QUESTIONS!

493
00:21:59,860 --> 00:22:02,822
